@startuml
' State machine per BTW turn; Topic remains for follow-up
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description
[*] --> Admission
Admission --> Running : durable persist-first checkpoint
Admission --> Rejected : validation / busy / storage error
Admission --> Cancelled : cancel while committing\n(no model call)
Rejected --> [*]
Running --> Complete : model finished + durable terminal
Running --> Cancelled : explicit BTW cancel + terminal
Running --> Error : provider failure + terminal
Running --> Interrupted : Host crash / stale owner repair
Complete --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
Error --> [*]
Interrupted --> [*]

note right of Complete
  A future follow-up creates a NEW
  BTW Turn under the SAME Topic.
  It does not reopen this terminal Turn.
end note
note right of Running
  Per Session: at most one active Turn.
  Reader disconnect != cancellation.
end note
@enduml
